    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/aa2945a927de52f23a3028863f61839c.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/b15072c3e977284b60a6ac372b72b8fe.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/b15072c3e977284b60a6ac372b72b8fe.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/b15072c3e977284b60a6ac372b72b8fe.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clickonomy</strong> is a cozy minimalist game where you gather resources by clicking and selling them in a dynamic market. Even something as simple as a fruit can surprise you with its value each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a charming procedurally generated planet. Enjoy satisfying destruction mechanics as you grow your Gem collection while unlocking new Skills and earning Credits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/aca8ecf5f9cc5056e8feecdb32df320a.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/a02891a8462006aa82485f82bea9a777.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/a02891a8462006aa82485f82bea9a777.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/a02891a8462006aa82485f82bea9a777.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling plays a key role in your journey to gain a better Reputation! Use the Recycler to trade extra resources for powerful upgrades like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More credits per item sold</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bigger storage</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Better mining and collecting abilities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Access to new resource types</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Higher Extractor output and Gem drop rates</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/9c25e6fa3add8ee1b0e1b2ba7dacef91.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/868509c361e0bb9379affac37c947857.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/868509c361e0bb9379affac37c947857.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/868509c361e0bb9379affac37c947857.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beacon is a central hub for selling resources. The more you click, the more you earn \u2014 accompanied by satisfying sounds and effects. Clicking has never felt this addicting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/af0b39e85ee3d91e09728b6e2da13858.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/81078abe358592349e87d4a1859bcd59.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/81078abe358592349e87d4a1859bcd59.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/81078abe358592349e87d4a1859bcd59.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate extraction mode on the Beacon to discover Gem Stones automatically \u2014 even while you're not playing. Open them to reveal rare Gems to grow your collection and level up your Reputation Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might even get very special ones...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/dbe286950db7ff6a91285ec8235f32b1.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/6626c0de4a140970cff45e1109a3607d.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/6626c0de4a140970cff45e1109a3607d.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/6626c0de4a140970cff45e1109a3607d.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the perfect photos and discover pretty views with photo mode. Show off your photography skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around your new home, enjoy the delicate atmosphere, and embrace the feeling of exploration.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/aa2945a927de52f23a3028863f61839c.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/b15072c3e977284b60a6ac372b72b8fe.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/b15072c3e977284b60a6ac372b72b8fe.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/b15072c3e977284b60a6ac372b72b8fe.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clickonomy</strong> is a cozy minimalist game where you gather resources by clicking and selling them in a dynamic market. Even something as simple as a fruit can surprise you with its value each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a charming procedurally generated planet. Enjoy satisfying destruction mechanics as you grow your Gem collection while unlocking new Skills and earning Credits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/aca8ecf5f9cc5056e8feecdb32df320a.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/a02891a8462006aa82485f82bea9a777.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/a02891a8462006aa82485f82bea9a777.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/a02891a8462006aa82485f82bea9a777.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling plays a key role in your journey to gain a better Reputation! Use the Recycler to trade extra resources for powerful upgrades like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>More credits per item sold</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bigger storage</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Better mining and collecting abilities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Access to new resource types</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Higher Extractor output and Gem drop rates</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/9c25e6fa3add8ee1b0e1b2ba7dacef91.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/868509c361e0bb9379affac37c947857.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/868509c361e0bb9379affac37c947857.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/868509c361e0bb9379affac37c947857.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beacon is a central hub for selling resources. The more you click, the more you earn \u2014 accompanied by satisfying sounds and effects. Clicking has never felt this addicting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/af0b39e85ee3d91e09728b6e2da13858.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/81078abe358592349e87d4a1859bcd59.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/81078abe358592349e87d4a1859bcd59.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/81078abe358592349e87d4a1859bcd59.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate extraction mode on the Beacon to discover Gem Stones automatically \u2014 even while you're not playing. Open them to reveal rare Gems to grow your collection and level up your Reputation Points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might even get very special ones...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/dbe286950db7ff6a91285ec8235f32b1.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/6626c0de4a140970cff45e1109a3607d.poster.avif?t=1750706999\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/6626c0de4a140970cff45e1109a3607d.webm?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284800/extras/6626c0de4a140970cff45e1109a3607d.mp4?t=1750706999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the perfect photos and discover pretty views with photo mode. Show off your photography skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around your new home, enjoy the delicate atmosphere, and embrace the feeling of exploration.</p>",
